                        <div class="article-header__content">
                            <h1 class="article-header__title">Power Technology Excellence Awards 2022: EDP</h1>
                                                                                        
                                <p class="article-header__excerpt">EDP is a Portuguese utility company recognized in Environmental, M&A and Research and Development in the Power Technology Excellence Awards</p>

